:: Crawlway1-dark
(set: $thud_lvl to 1)
(if: $lantern_lit is true)[(goto: "Crawlway1")]
You crouch in a dark tunnel, unable to see your hand in front of your face.

(display: "CurrentSoundMsg")

(if: ($has: "lantern"))[\
  Light your [lantern]<lantern|.
  (click: ?lantern)[\
    (set: $lantern_lit to true)\
    (goto: "Crawlway1")
  ]
]
[[Turn back->Storeroom]]


:: Crawlway1
(set: $thud_lvl to 1)
Your lantern burns brightly.

The rock walls appear smooth, as if dug by flowing water pressure. The tunnel makes a turn up ahead out of sight.

(display: "CurrentSoundMsg")

[[Follow it.->Crawlway2]]
[[Turn back->Storeroom]]


:: Crawlway2
(set: $thud_lvl to 2)
It takes some time to crawl through the narrow tunnel, but you make steady progress. Your lantern sputters but remains strong.

(display: "CurrentSoundMsg")

[[Continue.->Crawlway3]]
[[Turn back->Crawlway1]]


:: Crawlway3
(set: $thud_lvl to 2)
At last the tunnel widens enough for you to nearly stand. Ahead, the floor drops away into a broad, dark cavern.

(display: "CurrentSoundMsg")

[[Climb down into the cavern->Junction]]
[[Turn back->Crawlway2]]
